  "description": "Kosaraju SCC on vertices [base,max_index], with dense component IDs [0,k). For each inter-component edge u->v, component(u)<component(v): ascending IDs are a topological order. get_group(cid) and groups() return cached const references; member order is DFS order, and root(cid) is a representative, not necessarily the smallest vertex. it_cid(f,rev=false) visits IDs ascending by default or descending when true. it_all(f,rev=false) follows that component order while retaining member order within each group. it_group(cid,f) visits that group only. Build recomputes from preserved edges; rebuild after input edits. Group views refer to the current build. Only adj,group,comp,cc are protected for extensions; reverse edges and traversal scratch state are private. Build O(n+m), group getters O(1), it_cid O(k), it_all O(n), it_group O(group size)."
